#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:5 08ed3b8d3d94435bb0219c7db4eedcaa
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门指南"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:6 a386f800c27c49f0836a7c05256387c7
msgid ""
"This article provides an overview of the main components you will need to "
"building and use an ArduPilot-based blimp."
msgstr "本文概览搭建并使用基于 ArduPilot 的飞艇所需的主要组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:10 99bcc5e0edba40088e97c2cd87782615
msgid "ArduPilot Flapping Fin Blimp"
msgstr "ArduPilot 拍翼飞艇"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:12 9c58ab4122604e96836266dfba60b218
msgid ""
"This is the first release of dedicated firmware for an ArduPilot based "
"Blimp. While there are several commercially available Blimps using brushless"
" motors and/or fins as control surfaces which could be adapted to use the "
"Plane firmware, this release is the first ArduPilot firmware targeted "
"specifically to lighter-than-air (LTA) vehicles."
msgstr ""
"这是基于 ArduPilot 的专用 Blimp 固件的首个版本。市面上已有若干商用飞艇使用无刷电机和/或翼面进行控制（可通过 Plane "
"固件适配），但本次发布是首个专门面向轻于空气（LTA）载具的 ArduPilot 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:14 010c7536db2a4e97b961a9b55f2a9de1
msgid ""
"The first release is a simple flapping fin Blimp that can be easily "
"constructed and is suitable for indoor use. It is capable of only lifting a "
"few grams besides its own envelope but serves as a good testing and "
"development platform. Follow these instructions to :ref:`build your own "
"<building-a-blimp>`."
msgstr ""
"首个版本是一种简单的拍翼飞艇，结构易于搭建，适合室内使用。除自身气囊外，仅能提供几克的载荷能力，但作为测试与开发平台非常合适。可按以下说明 "
":ref:`自行搭建 <building-a-blimp>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:16 8b1c4b60a0c64fb6875e120261ea432a
msgid ""
"It is expected that future development will be done to include the heavier "
"commercially available LTA vehicles or large do-it-yourself version that "
"could lift and utilize electric motors and/or control surfaces and heavier "
"peripherals. Contributors and Partners to this development would be "
"welcomed!"
msgstr ""
"预期未来的开发会扩展到更重的商用 LTA 载具，或可承载电机和/或控制面以及更重外设的大型 DIY 版本。欢迎贡献者与合作伙伴参与这些开发！"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:19 10068e2446864d519dd152481b7c64c3
msgid "5 or 6 channel (minimum) RC transmitter and receiver"
msgstr "至少 5 或 6 通道的 RC 遥控器和接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:21 2a654ad9f56c4d47bceb136aa10d3639
msgid ""
"You'll need a radio control transmitter to manually control your blimp and "
"to activate its flight modes. You can use any RC transmitter/receiver system"
" with at least 5 or 6 channels. Some of the options are discussed in the "
"topic :ref:`Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver Systems <common-rc-"
"systems>`."
msgstr ""
"你需要一台遥控发射机来手动控制飞艇，并切换飞行模式。可使用任何至少 5 或 6 通道的 RC 发射机/接收机系统。部分选项详见 :ref:`兼容的 RC"
" 发射机和接收机系统 <common-rc-systems>` 一节。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:29 c50799f036764990bd6b6eba280e5781
msgid ""
"5 channel systems would require either Rudder Arming or a GCS link to arm "
"and disarm, whereas 6+ channel systems can dedicate a channel and switch for"
" arming/disarming. Rudder/Throttle disarming is obviously problematic unless"
" in the HOLD mode."
msgstr ""
"5 通道系统要求使用 Rudder（方向舵）解锁，或通过 GCS 链路解锁/上锁；6 通道及以上的系统可专门分配一个通道和开关用于解锁/上锁。除 "
"HOLD 模式外，使用 Rudder/Throttle 上锁显然存在安全隐患。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:32 2727ef0d6b954d79aced2a4a23ce2add
msgid "Autopilot"
msgstr "飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:34 d22e1c051c894e569b2d94c9c4ab09be
msgid "Blimp requires an autopilot for control and autonomous flight."
msgstr "Blimp 需要飞控进行控制与自主飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:36 a78aad10db7a438da94c26cabf610beb
msgid ""
"Building an indoor blimp such as this, weight will usually be the primary "
"consideration, thus the \"single board\" type of autopilots are likely to be"
" most suitable, especially the \"mini\" (20x20mm or 16x16mm) versions."
msgstr ""
"搭建这样的室内飞艇时，重量通常是首要考虑因素，因此「单板」类型的飞控最为合适，尤其是「mini」（20x20mm 或 16x16mm）版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:39 93e78807ba9d412bbbf1b5bde2688a20
msgid ""
"For more options, see the topic :ref:`Choosing an autopilot <common-"
"autopilots>`."
msgstr "更多选项请参见 :ref:`选择飞控 <common-autopilots>` 一节。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:41 2e15e0a89c8c4236adb19fe87c39d992
msgid ""
"Four outputs are required for the actuators. Autopilot inputs for RC, "
"telemetry, GPS or Position Sensor, and Compass are also required. Main "
"battery voltage, and perhaps current sensing, are very useful also."
msgstr "需要四路输出驱动执行器。飞控还需要 RC 输入、数传、GPS 或位置传感器以及罗盘的输入。主电池电压（也许还有电流）传感器也很有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:44 20fa074032754a06bba175d76ea6c303
msgid "Position and Yaw Sensors"
msgstr "位置与偏航传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:46 07b25ab0225d41e6b64bca9b909e114f
msgid ""
"In order to use any of the position-controlled flight modes, ie any mode "
"other than HOLD or MANUAL, Blimp requires position information."
msgstr "若要使用任何依赖位置的飞行模式（即除 HOLD 与 MANUAL 之外的任意模式），Blimp 需要位置信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:48 439a5500bd6544bea1045e2d49928fb2
msgid ""
"For outdoor use, the simplest option is a :ref:`GPS module <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` generally with a compass."
msgstr ""
"对户外使用，最简单的选择是带罗盘的 :ref:`GPS 模块 <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-"
"module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:50 1d1ffd009cf74c4bb45b5d3829ee1065
msgid ""
"A compass is also required, because the velocities and speeds of the vehicle"
" are not large enough to assure that ArduPilot's algorithmic yaw estimator "
"for compass-less operation would ever converge."
msgstr "罗盘也是必须的，因为飞艇的速度与速率都不够大，无法保证 ArduPilot 的无罗盘偏航估算算法收敛。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:52 563781a52f3842e1b7d4d7052fcacb6d
msgid ""
"For indoor use, please see :ref:`the non-GPS options. <common-non-gps-"
"navigation-landing-page>`"
msgstr "对室内使用，请参见 :ref:`非 GPS 选项 <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:57 278d6c8d60024e7cb5f771cc2f37e54e
msgid ":ref:`common-ekf-sources` may be of interest also"
msgstr ":ref:`common-ekf-sources` 也可参考"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:61 3dcb0b24a9f34bcdbb36fd1bea894285
msgid "LiPo Batteries and Charger"
msgstr "锂聚合物电池与充电器"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:63 c7ec533716e64b918dc9f1fd5a5ba660
msgid ""
"Blimp requires a rechargeable lithium polymer (LiPo) battery. Blimps have "
"much lower power requirements than most UAVs but also lower payload capacity"
" for their size. Since blimps must always be neutrally buoyant (i.e. any "
"extra payload capacity will need to be compensated for by weights), it is a "
"good idea to use as big a battery as the blimp can use."
msgstr ""
"Blimp 需要可充电锂聚合物（LiPo）电池。飞艇的功耗远低于大多数 "
"UAV，但同等体积下的载荷能力也较低。由于飞艇必须始终保持中性浮力（多余的载荷需要用重物配平），尽可能使用飞艇能承载的最大电池是个好做法。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:69 48fe31e169d64b52862c4703584ff666
msgid ""
"For example, a blimp that is approximately 50 cm in diameter would likely be"
" able to fly at a slow pace for about 10-20 minutes on 150 mAh 1S. However "
"it likely has enough lift to carry double the capacity or more if there "
"aren't any cameras or other payload added."
msgstr ""
"例如，直径约 50 cm 的飞艇通常可以以慢速飞行约 10-20 分钟（150 mAh 1S "
"电池）。但如果没有相机或其他载荷，它通常有足够升力承载双倍甚至更多的电池容量。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:74 71c80ff82f8746ef8aadfd5f8c7eef65
msgid ""
"While a blimp generally uses only one battery at a time, we recommend having"
" a few batteries in stock; more batteries means more flight time. You'll "
"also need a charger for your batteries."
msgstr "飞艇一次一般只用一块电池，但建议备几块电池——电池越多飞行时间越长。还需要为电池准备一个充电器。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:77 5afa06a6328d48279a84caa7bced987b
msgid "Ground Control Station (GCS)"
msgstr "地面站（GCS）"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:79 040b7e1ceeba49eea2d77de0e1bb00af
msgid ""
"The (free and open source) :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` is "
"recommended if you're going to be loading new versions of Blimp onto the "
"autopilot, and for first-flight tuning and calibration."
msgstr ""
"推荐使用免费开源的 :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` ——尤其是为飞控刷写新版本 Blimp "
"固件，以及做首次飞行调参与校准时。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:86 1d9af4137b5a479ab6bc250235567ff1
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you may find it more convenient to choose a different ground "
"station - running on the tablet, phone or computer of your choice. The main "
"options are discussed in the topic :ref:`Choosing a Ground Station <common-"
"choosing-a-ground-station>`."
msgstr ""
"你也可以选择其他地面站——运行在平板、手机或电脑上，按自己的偏好。主要选项详见 :ref:`选择地面站 <common-choosing-a-"
"ground-station>` 一节。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:92 3490abfc408f43809222cf1a313a388e
msgid "Telemetry Radio"
msgstr "数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:94 ccc1a38834104c95a845fe104049a09c
msgid ""
"A telemetry radio allows your blimp to communicate with your ground station "
"from the air using the MAVLink protocol. This allows you to interact with "
"Blimp in real time and receive streaming data from your blimps."
msgstr "数传电台让飞艇能在空中通过 MAVLink 协议与地面站通信，从而实现实时交互与数传数据流接收。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:99 8b6a637626604b27ba7da4177429d3b9
msgid ""
"We recommend the telemetry radio solutions linked from the :ref:`Telemetry "
"Landing Page <common-telemetry-landingpage>`."
msgstr "我们推荐 :ref:`数传落地页 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` 中链接的数传电台方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:102 c1eed6b4c0a34d94907510468aa3d188
msgid ""
"A :ref:`Bluetooth<common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity>`, or WIFI "
"adapters, such as :ref:`common-esp32-telemetry` and :ref:`common-"
"esp8266-telemetry`, are lightweight and have enough range for indoor "
"operation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`蓝牙<common-mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity>` 或 WiFi 适配器，例如 "
":ref:`common-esp32-telemetry` 与 :ref:`common-"
"esp8266-telemetry`，都很轻便，对室内使用的距离足够。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:104 4b1432b98907444991788749d3369884
msgid ""
"Remember that if using an RF radio such as, the :ref:`SIK Radio <common-sik-"
"telemetry-radio>`, you will need the version at the permitted frequency for "
"your country - 915 MHz (Americas) and 433 MHz (Europe)."
msgstr ""
"请记得，如果使用射频电台（例如 :ref:`SIK 电台 <common-sik-telemetry-"
"radio>`），需要选购符合所在国家允许频段的版本——美洲为 915 MHz，欧洲为 433 MHz。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:110 25c7cd9b894e4ccabe61b212979e1027
msgid ""
"Also note that many RC systems have the capability built-in of providing "
"telemetry back to the RC transmitter for display and even limited GCS-like "
"control and parameter editing, notably :ref:`FRSky SPort, FPort<common-"
"frsky-telemetry>`, and :ref:`CRSF<common-crsf-telemetry>` systems,which also"
" have micro sized receivers suitable for this application."
msgstr ""
"另外，许多 RC 系统自身就支持把数传信息回传到 RC 发射机进行显示，甚至支持有限的类 GCS 控制与参数编辑——例如 :ref:`FRSky "
"SPort、FPort<common-frsky-telemetry>` 以及 :ref:`CRSF<common-crsf-telemetry>` "
"系统，它们也有适合本应用的微型接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:113 2f756ab99c06410c8c4baaf0b0b13fb6
msgid "Actuators"
msgstr "执行器"

#: ../../source/docs/getting-started.rst:115 34d12efb1fe14203b0b914a01d565d61
msgid ""
"For control and propulsion, the Flapping Fin Blimp uses micro servos, such "
"as `these <https://usa.banggood.com/search/1.7g-servo.html>`__ . Larger "
"versions could scale their size, accordingly."
msgstr ""
"在控制与推进方面，拍翼飞艇使用微型舵机，例如 `这些 "
"<https://usa.banggood.com/search/1.7g-servo.html>`__ 。更大的版本可按比例增大舵机尺寸。"
